    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_13",
      "hash64": "D97660BDBDC27357",
      "text": "¿Qué es, por cierto? ¿Una MT?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_13",
      "hash64": "2C6A2C047B62A03F",
      "text": "Alguien que investigaba el Área Cero envió este\\ndisco a uno de los financiadores del proyecto,\\r\\nhace ya tiempo.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_14",
      "hash64": "2C6A29047B629B26",
      "text": "Le pedí a mi equipo que lo analizara y, sin atisbo\\nde duda, no se trata de ninguna MT.\\c\\nPero tampoco estamos ante un mero dispositivo\\nde almacenamiento.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_15",
      "hash64": "2C6A2A047B629CD9",
      "text": "No sabemos siquiera cuál es su función, pero\\ndeduzco que está relacionado con el Área Cero.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_16",
      "hash64": "2C6A27047B6297C0",
      "text": "Ya que ese es vuestro destino, pensé que quizá\\npodríais aprovechar para esclarecer la cuestión.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_14",
      "hash64": "D9765DBDBDC26E3E",
      "text": "¡Hala! Y se lo dices así, en plan \"ya que os pasáis\\npor el Hazme Cazo, traedme una ensaladillita\"...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_17",
      "hash64": "2C6A28047B629973",
      "text": "Eso sí, te ruego que me lo restituyas en caso de\\nno encontrar la ocasión de utilizarlo.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_18",
      "hash64": "2C6A35047B62AF8A",
      "text": "El Área Cero todavía está rodeada de múltiples\\nincógnitas.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_19",
      "hash64": "2C6A36047B62B13D",
      "text": "Por mucho que hayas visitado sus profundidades,\\nextrema la cautela tanto con el terreno como con\\r\\nlos Pokémon que allí habitan.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_20",
      "hash64": "2C6727047B6061E9",
      "text": "Por favor, guía a todos los demás en tu calidad\\nde Campe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ónona.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_15",
      "hash64": "D9765EBDBDC26FF1",
      "text": "Yo me apuntaba de buena gana, pero es lo que\\ntiene esto de ser una curranta.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_16",
      "hash64": "D9765BBDBDC26AD8",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]¡Tú puedes, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Pero ojo, tampoco\\nte pases\\r\\ntres pueblos, ¿eh? Que nos conocemos.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_21",
      "hash64": "2C6726047B606036",
      "text": "Bien, con tu permiso.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_brother_01",
      "hash64": "3C46D606237D94A9",
      "text": "¿Cómo se llamaba el sitio ese? ¿Área Cero?\\nMe muero de ganas ya. Vámonos de una vez.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_sister_01",
      "hash64": "E5ED13B7E0189975",
      "text": "Veo al enano muy pero que muy calladito...\\nMe pregunto si estará bien.\\c\\nPorque, tras la derrota, anda que no estaba fuera\\nde sí ni nada...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
